</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <em id="bib.bib53.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">NeurIPS</em>, 2017.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib54" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Yang et al. (2024)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Y. Yang, N. Jiang, Y. Xu, and D. Zhan.

</span>
