</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib54.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">IEEE Trans. Pattern Anal. Mach. Intell.</em>, 46(12):8334–8347, 2024.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib55" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhao and Han (2021)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
B. Zhao and K. Han.

</span>
